  <History Date="08-04-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="31-01-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's to modes 1 and 2.  Added product thumbnail.  Added channel counts to mode names." />
  <History Date="02-02-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added mode 3 and 4 Atlabase ID's.  Changed name from CM-S6 to Solaris (CM-S6)" />
  <History Date="03-02-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed RGBW masters to default at zero.  Revised star shutter closed DMX range." />
  <History Date="14-02-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added RDM ID's.  Minor change to star random function 2 name." />
  <History Date="15-05-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed RGBW FX functions from fixed to variable range in line with latest charts in response to manufacturer request." />
  <History Date="20-05-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised RGBW FX Switch and RGBW FX Mode locate values in response to manufacturer request." />
